n is absolutely incredible its so satisfying to fly across the map just for a single powerup! also the combat is so much fun, the sound effects are so satisfying the ping pong ballers are the  best item in the entire game, the sound it makes when it triggers is the absolute best! to everone who struggles with to much on your screen... use a sunflower fly across the map and get that ADHD buff!!!!!! the difficulty is exactly what it needs to be, it makes the game hard and to all you people complaining about it being too hard you would be complaining if it was too easy. also side note dumbassess", "timestamp_created": 1775541326, "timestamp_updated": 1775541326, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1775655449, "developer_response": "thanks for the review and shoutout to all the dumbassess. ", "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222717507", "author": {"steamid": "76561198868522351", "personaname": "KitsunaSang", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198868522351/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 833, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 730, "last_played": 1775685579, "avatar": "198fe94358c7451d91b71229efab9efe3fe97a76"}, "language": "english", "review": "สนุกมากงับ เพลินๆเลยเล่นกับเพื่อนๆคืออย่างนัว ใครที่ชอบ Risk of Rain หรือ Muck ถูกใจแน่นอนงับ", "timestamp_created": 1775536757, "timestamp_updated": 1775536757, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1775655325, "developer_response": "ขอบคุณสำหร